# C.16 Physical Integration Gate

即使模块RTL可以实施，如果依赖：

```text
DFI Physical Mapping
Read Return
Write Visibility
Training Carrier
Reset Old-feedback Drain
```

等尚未签署的PHY行为，则仍保持：

```text
PHYSICAL_INTEGRATION_BLOCKED
```

因此必须区分：

```text
Semantic RTL Ready
```

与：

```text
Physical Positive Path Ready
```

两者不能互相替代。

